Package: tcspecial-ground
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: David VomLehn <dvomlehn@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS@, python3
Recommends: python3-yaml, python3-tk, pkgconf
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcspecial
Description: tcspecial's ground libraries and configuration editor
 What a ground station for tcspecial is built on: libtcs, tcslib for C and
 C++, with its header tcs.h and pkg-config file tcs.pc; the Python
 packages tcslibgs, tcslib and tcsui; and tcsgui, the graphical
 configuration editor, with its node descriptions and schemas. Everything
 is under /opt/tcs. /etc/ld.so.conf.d/tcspecial-ground.conf puts
 /opt/tcs/lib on the loader's path, a .pth file puts the Python packages on
 python3's, and /etc/profile.d/tcspecial-ground.sh puts /opt/tcs/bin and
 /opt/tcs/lib/pkgconfig on the shell's and pkg-config's.
